# Nexora PvP Arena — Full Real-Time Production System

## What Was Built

The PvP Arena was completely converted from a demo with hardcoded mock data into a production-ready real-time competitive system.

---

## Changes Made

### Backend

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| [models.py](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/models.py) | Added 5 new DB tables: `pvp_matchmaking_queue`, `pvp_match_results`, [pvp_rating](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/routers/pvp.py#691-713), `pvp_match_history`. Enhanced [PvPMatch](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/schemas.py#114-126) with `battle_type`, `skill_id`, [match_status](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/routers/pvp.py#350-413), `spectator_count`. |
| [routers/pvp.py](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/routers/pvp.py) | Complete rewrite — 11 real endpoints, no mock data. MMR-based matchmaking, real XP/MMR rewards, battle history, leaderboard, forfeit, live matches feed. |
| [battle_realtime.py](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/battle_realtime.py) | **New file.** Full Socket.IO real-time server with match rooms, server-controlled timer, spectator mode, disconnect grace handling, live score broadcasts, and MATCH_END events. |
| [main.py](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/backend/main.py) | Mounted Socket.IO at `/battle/socket.io` — wraps FastAPI with `socketio.ASGIApp`. All REST routes continue to work. |
| [nginx/nginx.conf](file:///e:/NEXORA/NEXORA/nexora-skill-forge-main/nginx/nginx.conf) | `/battle/` now proxies to `core_api` (Socket.IO embedded), with WebSocket upgrade headers + 1hr timeout. |

